# The build context is the whole directory, and two of these entries are not about size:
#
# - `.venv` holds Windows wheels. Copied into a Linux image it produces an environment that imports
#   nothing and fails at startup with a message about `cp312-win_amd64`.
# - `tests/fixtures/images` and `report.pdf` are outputs of a previous run; the fixtures are rebuilt
#   by `make_fixtures.py` when a test needs them.
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
artifacts
data
scratch
*.log
ml/.smoke
ml/.probe
browser-shots
